  "description": "V1 SaaS Plugin Pro launch metrics: claims/day, MRR estimate, active Pro tenants, plugin-claim middleware health. Drives the operational view of the $9.99 / 90-day paid tier (issue #1886). Data source: agent /prometheus endpoint, scraped by Prometheus. Read the panel descriptions for query semantics + how to interpret the MRR forward-looking estimate.",
